Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 16:40:05 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1/6] fix(ui): stop idle redraw CPU spin

Schedule frames for input, egui animation, imports, and active playback while letting an idle or hidden window wait. Keep one follow-up frame for viewport state changes and stop polling a paused stock worker after its target is shown.

Refs #164
